let w = dataset(wages)
w.plot(x: educ, y: mean(wage))
error[Z0401]: an expression mapped to an aesthetic cannot use `mean`, a function of `data`
 --> scripts/main.zeff:2:20
  |
2 | w.plot(x: educ, y: mean(wage))
  |                    ^^^^ not kept in a mapping
  |
  = help: a mapping is computed from variables, numbers, the operators and the functions of `core`, as in `log(wage)` or `wage / hours`; compute anything else with `add` first and map the new variable

